"name": "TripAdvisor, Inc.",
"description": "TripAdvisor, Inc. is an online travel company, which owns and operates a portfolio of online travel brands. It operates through the following segments: Experiences, Hotels and Other, and TheFork. The Experiences segment includes both Viator and Tripadvisor points of sale. The Hotel and Other segment manages the hotel and restaurant guidance platform. The TheFork segment provides an online marketplace that enables diners to discover and book online reservations. The company was founded by Nicholas Shanny and Stephen Kaufer in February 2000 and is headquartered in Needham, MA.",
